# Arch's iio-sensor-proxy rule enables only SSC light and compass. The same
# FastRPC endpoint also carries the Tab S5e's LSM6DSM accelerometer.  The
# factory SSC registry exposes a zero placement matrix even though Samsung's
# device-specific configuration declares x=-y, y=-x, z=-z.  Pass that real
# panel-space matrix to iio-sensor-proxy instead of its identity fallback.
SUBSYSTEM=="misc", KERNEL=="fastrpc-adsp", ENV{IIO_SENSOR_PROXY_TYPE}+="ssc-accel", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}="0, -1, 0; -1, 0, 0; 0, 0, -1"
